<title>MEXICO: GGemex changes name to Pepsi-Gemex.</title>
<headline>GGemex changes name to Pepsi-Gemex.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Embotellador de Mexico S.A. de C.V. (GGemex) changed its trading name to Pepsi-Gemex S.A. de C.V. at an extraordinary shareholders' assembly held on March 13, a company official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It was changed out of convenience to Gemex,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The official added a decision had yet to be taken as to whether the company's ticker symbol would also change on the Mexico Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9562))</p>
